{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15thラスト全握でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/01/1702064/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニライブのセトリは前にあげたのを\n見ていただけると助かります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の\n『命の真実 ミュージカル「林檎売りとカメムシ」』の相手役は\nかずみんでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"予想は当たったかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/01/1702064/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃんと一緒のレーンでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/01/1702064/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/01/1702064/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃん推しの方は\n顔からして優しそうな方が多かった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかげで楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/01/1702064/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、\n中国地方のアンダーライブ終わりで\n全握の中では一番近い京都の握手会だったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブがきっかけで\n初めて今日来てくださった方が多かったように\n思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/01/1702064/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感想を直接 聞けて嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16レーンに来てくださったみなさん\n本当にありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は個別です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２日連続、\n沈金もいれたら３日連続中田と会ってる\nなんて方も いるんですかね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/01/1702064/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分ってこういう一面あるんだと気づいた瞬間は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/01/1702064/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、何とも言えない気持ちになった出来事は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ループしすぎて話題ないとき\n初めましてで何話したらいいかわかんないとき\n答えを教えてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ち物チェック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"□握手券\n□身分証明書\n(□トレード用の写真等)\n(□メンバーへのプレゼント)\n(□グッズ買うためのお金)\n□推しに対する愛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も楽しい握手会にしましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/01/1702064/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}